# Deployment Strategy — DonateNow

> Reference: [architecture.mdc](./architecture.mdc) | [security.mdc](./security.mdc) | [testing.mdc](./testing.mdc)

---

## 1. Hosting Architecture

| Component | Platform | Plan |
|---|---|---|
| Next.js App | Vercel | Free / Hobby |
| Database | Supabase | Free Tier |
| Payments | Razorpay | Test Mode (Free) |
| Domain | Custom (optional) | Vercel DNS or external |

---

## 2. Environments

| Environment | Purpose | Branch | URL |
|---|---|---|---|
| Local Dev | Development + testing | `main` (local) | `http://localhost:3000` |
| Preview | PR review + staging | Feature branches | `https://<branch>.vercel.app` |
| Production | Live application | `main` | `https://donatenow.vercel.app` |

---

## 3. Vercel Deployment Configuration

### Project Setup
```bash
# Install Vercel CLI (optional)
npm i -g vercel

# Deploy from project root
vercel

# Or connect via Vercel Dashboard:
# 1. Import Git repository
# 2. Framework Preset: Next.js
# 3. Root Directory: ./
# 4. Build Command: next build
# 5. Output Directory: .next
```

### Build Settings
```
Framework Preset: Next.js
Node.js Version: 18.x
Build Command: npm run build
Install Command: npm install
Output Directory: .next
```

### Environment Variables (Vercel Dashboard)
```
# Set each variable in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables

NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_xxxxxxxxxx
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...
```

### Scope Settings
| Variable | Development | Preview | Production |
|---|---|---|---|
| Razorpay Keys | Test keys | Test keys | **Production keys** |
| Supabase URL | Dev project | Dev project | **Production project** |
| Webhook Secret | Test secret | Test secret | **Production secret** |

