## 4. Supabase Setup

### Project Creation
1. Go to [supabase.com](https://supabase.com) → Create Project
2. Select region closest to users (e.g., Mumbai for India)
3. Set database password (save securely)
4. Note down: Project URL, Anon Key, Service Role Key

### Database Migration
```bash
# Option 1: Use Supabase SQL Editor
# Paste SQL from ERD.mdc → Section 5

# Option 2: Use Supabase CLI
npx supabase init
npx supabase db push
```

### RLS Setup
- Run RLS policies from [security.mdc](./security.mdc) → Section 4
- Verify via Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Policies

### Seed Data
- Run seed SQL from [ERD.mdc](./ERD.mdc) → Section 6
- Create admin user via Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Users

---

## 5. Razorpay Setup

### Test Mode Configuration
1. Sign up at [razorpay.com](https://razorpay.com)
2. Navigate to Settings → API Keys
3. Generate **Test Mode** keys
4. Note down: `key_id` (starts with `rzp_test_`) and `key_secret`

### Webhook Configuration
1. Go to Razorpay Dashboard → Settings → Webhooks
2. Add new webhook:
   - URL: `https://donatenow.vercel.app/api/webhook/razorpay`
   - Secret: Generate and save
   - Events: `payment.captured`, `payment.failed`
   - Active: Yes

### For Local Webhook Testing
```bash
# Use ngrok to expose local server
ngrok http 3000

# Configure Razorpay webhook URL to ngrok URL:
# https://<random>.ngrok.io/api/webhook/razorpay
```

---

## 6. Local Development Setup

```bash
# 1. Clone repository
git clone <repo-url>
cd DonateNow

# 2. Install dependencies
npm install

# 3. Create environment file
cp .env.example .env.local

# 4. Fill in environment variables in .env.local

# 5. Run development server
npm run dev

# 6. Open browser
# http://localhost:3000        → Donation page
# http://localhost:3000/admin  → Admin panel
```

---

## 7. CI/CD Pipeline (Future)

```
Push to feature branch
  → Vercel Preview Deployment (auto)
  → Run linting (npm run lint)
  → Run unit tests (npm run test)
  → Preview URL generated for review

Merge to main
  → Vercel Production Deployment (auto)
  → Run full test suite
  → Deploy to production URL
```

---

## 8. Deployment Checklist

### Before First Deployment
- [ ] Supabase project created
- [ ] Database tables created (run migration SQL)
- [ ] RLS policies applied
- [ ] Seed data inserted (cause + admin user)
- [ ] Razorpay test keys generated
- [ ] Razorpay webhook configured
- [ ] All environment variables set in Vercel
- [ ] `.env.local` is in `.gitignore`
- [ ] Build succeeds locally (`npm run build`)
- [ ] All tests pass (`npm run test`)

### Before Going to Production (Future)
- [ ] Switch to Razorpay **Live Mode** keys
- [ ] Create separate Supabase production project
- [ ] Update webhook URL to production domain
- [ ] Enable HTTPS (Vercel handles automatically)
- [ ] Set up custom domain (optional)
- [ ] Configure Vercel Analytics (optional)
- [ ] Test full payment flow with real card
- [ ] Backup database migration scripts
